WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.840
- [Jay] Good to see
you, it's been a while.

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.600
- Yes, it's been a while. Good to see you.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.960
- Now, how's the family?

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.710
You've had more kids, how
many kids do you have now?

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:08.130
- I got three kids.
- Okay.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:11.937
- I have a 26-year-old
and a 12-year-old boy,

00:00:11.937 --> 00:00:14.700
the 26-year-old's a
girl, 10-year-old girl,

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.760
and a 12-year-old boy.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.920
- Oh okay, so took a little break there.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.640
- Yeah. (laughs)

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.990
Yeah, took a little time off.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.630
- Oh gosh, look, the time flies.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.080
Yeah, all right, so.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.760
Wow, okay.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.940
But, like, there's 10 years
between myself and my brother,

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.320
so actually that's not that unusual to me.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.370
- Yeah, same with my sisters.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:34.980
They are eight and 10 years older.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.210
- Right, right.
- Yeah.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.270
- And of course, we were all planned.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.903
- Oh yeah.

00:00:40.859 --> 00:00:42.890
Well, I can't tell you what
my father said about that

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.240
'cause this is daytime television,

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.690
but yes, we were not planned.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.770
- Yeah, not planned.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.860
Now, any signs that the children

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.260
are going the "Jackass" route?

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.370
Has the gene literally
fallen from the tree?

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:54.203
- Well, luckily-

00:00:54.203 --> 00:00:55.690
- [Jay] Hit them in the head, you know.

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.243
- Luckily, my daughters,

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:00.690
that gene didn't get passed down to them.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:01.860
They're so, you know,

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:05.110
girls are just smarter than boys

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:07.650
and I don't have to worry about them,

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.730
but my son is just like my father.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:13.720
So he's got that funny
look in his eye, and yeah,

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:14.743
so I have to worry about Rocko.

00:01:14.743 --> 00:01:16.310
- Both pupils in the same
eye, that kind of thing?

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.783
- Yeah, yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.

